{
"#name"
:
{
"cosmo"
:
null
,
"en"
:
"Run the application built by Cosmopolitan"
,
"zh"
:
"运行 cosmo 系列的应用程序"
}
,
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"The cosmo suite of applications refers to software tools compiled with the Cosmopolitan C Library. Cosmopolitan, an open-source project developed by Justine Tunney, aims to compile C/C++ programs into universal binaries capable of running across multiple operating systems like Windows, Linux, and macOS, all without the need for virtual machines or interpreters.\nFor more information about the Cosmopolitan project, please visit https://justine.lol/cosmopolitan/\n"
,
"zh"
:
"cosmo 系列的应用程序是指用 Cosmopolitan C Library 编译的软件工具。Cosmopolitan 是由 Justine Tunney 开发的开源项目，它旨在将 C/C++ 程序编译成能在 Windows、Linux、macOS 等多个操作系统上运行的通用二进制文件（无需虚拟机或解释器）。\n关于 Cosmopolitan 项目的更多介绍，请访问 https://justine.lol/cosmopolitan/\n"
}
,
"#subcmd:common"
:
[
"use|--use"
,
"unuse|--unuse"
,
"--ls|-l"
,
"--which|-w"
,
"--author|-a"
]
,
"#subcmd:advanced"
:
[
"--install|-i"
,
"--ape"
,
"--run"
,
"--ll"
,
"--add"
]
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"en"
:
"\"x cosmo <bin>\" by default utilizes the APE loader (automatically downloaded upon first use) to execute the binary, equivalent to \"x cosmo --aperun <bin>\".\n"
,
"zh"
:
"`x cosmo <bin>` 默认使用 APE 加载程序（首次使用时自动下载）来执行 bin，相当于 `x cosmo --ape run <bin>`\n"
}
]
,
